        "objective_function": "Maximize portfolio cut quality / minimize normalized cut; weighted Max-Cut objective C(x) = -∑_{i,j} w_ij x_i(1-x_j) - ∑_i w_i x_i, with Ising mapping xi -> (1-Zi)/2.",
